A VehicleRental base class can contain common behavior such as calculating rental duration, storing customer details, and generating rental bills.
The CarRental and TruckRental classes can inherit these features and override methods for their specific requirements.
For example, CarRental may calculate charges based on car type, while TruckRental may include additional charges based on load capacity.
This design promotes code reuse, reduces duplication, and allows new rental types to be added with minimal changes to existing code
